  "morphology": {
    "compounding_rule": "Germanic dithematic ([quality](stem) + element: Eisarna-burgs, iron-fort) layered over Akkadian construct-chains (Bit-[god], Dur-[ruler], Kar-[god]): the capital Ashur-heim (Ashur's-home), Dur-Theuda (fort of the Theuda-house).",
