  "titles": {
    "_tiers_note": "Gothic ladder, ascending, with the Akkadian substrate co-titles beneath. Gardingus (king's-man) barony; Marka-frauja (march-lord) march; Kindins (provincial governor) county; Drauhtins (war-lord; *druhtinaz) duchy; Reiks (prince-ruler) principality; Thiudans (king) kingdom over a Thiudangardi (Gothic 'kingdom'); Sharr-Thiudans (the king-of-kings; Akk sharru + Gmc thiudans) empire over the Kishsha-Thiudi (the 'totality of the people'). The conquered cities keep their Akkadian shaknu (governor) and sangu (priest) beneath the Germanic crown. The gudja (priest) and the scribal shatammu stand outside the ladder. Rank titles fuse the real Gothic and Akkadian registers (allowed).",
    "display_policy": "Ruler/domain titles shown in setting-gen, domain lists and vassal trees are ENGLISH (or an approved commonly-known foreign term where set in 'ruler'). The *_native conlang forms are for NPC DIALOGUE ONLY, never for structural/UI displays.",
